              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'ebyo omugabe Ahasuero yaakuza Hamani mwene Hamedasa Omugagi, yaamugira omutegyeki mukuru, ekitebe kye yaakiha omwanya gw'ahaiguru okukira eby'abanyiginya bagyenzi be boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 5:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abashaija b'omugabe boona, abaabaire batuura aha irembo ry'omugabe bakaba bamwinamira, bamutangirira; ahakuba omugabe nikwo yaabaire aragiire. Kwonka Morodekai we akaba atamwinamira, n'obu kwakuba okumutangirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abo bashiaja b'omugabe baabuuza Morodekai ogwo bati: Ahabw'enki noohenda ekiragiro ky'omugabe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaguma nibamuteisa buri izooba, yaayanga kubahurira, nabo nikwo kubigambira Hamani, ngu bareebe ku araabe naikiriza ebya Morodekai; ahabw'okuba akaba naayetonganira ngu n'Omuyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani ku yaareebire Morodekai ataamwinamira, n'obu kwakuba okumutangirira, yaagira ekiniga kingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka yaareeba okukwata Morodekai wenka, ku kitaine mugasho; ahabw'okuba bakaba bamugambiire eihanga rya Morodekai. N'ahabw'ekyo yaasherura oburyo bw'okucwekyereza Abayudaaya boona, abaabaire bari omu bugabe bwona obwa Ahasuero, eihanga rya Morodekai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
